-- 6. Dissolve — pads and drone only, then silence

-- fade the remaining moving layers together (keep d1/d2/d3 for the tail)
fadeSilence 24 [4,5,6,7,8,9]
-- leave the low pad and sub
xfadeIn 2 24 $ lowPad # lpf 500
xfadeIn 1 24 $ subDrone # lpf 140

-- let the last chord ring, then hush
xfadeIn 3 24 $ highPad # lpf 900

-- final silence
fadeSilence 16 [1,2,3]

hush
